course: dictionary
lesson: 1292
title: Buyers and sellers
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A buyer is a person who buys something. When you pay for a bike and take it home, you are the buyer. The person who sells the bike is the seller. In a money word problem, the buyer pays and gets change back.
explain: Buyer can also mean a person whose job is choosing and buying goods for a shop or company. Look at the words around it to tell which meaning fits. «Honest shops last because buyers come back» means people who choose to spend their money there again and again.
explain: Buyers are people who want to purchase things, and «A tidy house helps buyers imagine living there» shows they are looking to buy. A smart buyer compares prices and looks for scams before paying.
explain: The phrase buyer beware is a warning. It means the person buying must check carefully before they pay. Try your meaning in the sentence: "The buyer pays and gets change back" still makes sense, so buyer means the person who buys.
fact: A buyer is a person who buys something.
fact: A seller is the person who sells it, and a buyer and a seller make a sale together.
fact: A fashion buyer is someone whose job is choosing and buying clothes for a shop.
fact: «Buyers» at an auction compete to pay the most for an item.
fact: Buyer beware means check carefully before you pay.
exercise: «The buyer paid for the bike and got change back.» Who is the buyer? | *The person who buys the bike | The person who sells the bike | The bell on the bike | The shop that builds bikes
exercise: Maya says a fashion buyer is a person who makes clothes. What does fashion buyer really mean? | A person who sews clothes at home | *A person whose job is choosing and buying clothes for a shop | A person who wears the newest clothes | A person who sells clothes at a market
exercise: «A tidy house helps buyers imagine living there.» Find and copy one word that means people who want to buy. | tidy | house | living | *buyers
test: «A smart buyer compares prices before paying.» What does a smart buyer do? | Pays the first price without looking | Never goes shopping | Sells things at a market | *Checks prices before paying
test: Buyer beware is a phrase that means what? | *Be careful before you pay | Buyers are always right | Only sellers need to care | Shop early in the morning
exam: In «Buyers and sellers agree a price», who is the buyer? | The shop's building | The person who makes the item | *The person who pays to get the item | The price tag
